n※公式設定の身長(チェリム0.5m、アブリボン0.2m)のイメージです", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@o_ko_ge__/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/745f44c9/uploads/origins/42e52f90-1588-42f7-9751-bd297bc29083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1520a088048507299dcab8220d37bcb6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/745f44c9/uploads/origins/42e52f90-1588-42f7-9751-bd297bc29083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1520a088048507299dcab8220d37bcb6, https://si.imgix.net/745f44c9/uploads/origins/42e52f90-1588-42f7-9751-bd297bc29083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=083a2f333ff060dd176533cd9e5f3ea0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/745f44c9/uploads/origins/42e52f90-1588-42f7-9751-bd297bc29083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4cae26a3204f0b88277d9815f5aee533 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "この2つを遊ばせておくことはできますか？青い方がサイズが大きいです\n\nこの2つ\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/606965003484135440/1061022325178384424/Kitsu_adopt_named_Neve_for_Ballisade.png\nhttps://discord.com/channels/@me/606965003484135440/1061017681949638656\n\nその他の参考文献\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/606965003484135440/1061024218004856952/Blaze_Neve_Hug.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@o_ko_ge__/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ad274b5/uploads/origins/096aa7bf-aa2b-4184-b98d-f00d430c010f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1be001276bea4cb4301af372645e506", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7ad274b5/uploads/origins/096aa7bf-aa2b-4184-b98d-f00d430c010f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1be001276bea4cb4301af372645e506, https://si.imgix.net/7ad274b5/uploads/origins/096aa7bf-aa2b-4184-b98d-f00d430c010f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67e95b2b487229f4563fd6997aa8c290 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7ad274b5/uploads/origins/096aa7bf-aa2b-4184-b98d-f00d430c010f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d780576790d69be37464ab6137a28e31 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。私のPrimarina（アシレーヌ）のキャラクター、Ashireneのアートをお願いできないでしょうか。\n私はあなたのアートスタイルにとても興味があり、あなたのスタイルでアシレーヌのアートワークをお願いしたいです。\nしかし、もしやりすぎだと感じたり、自分に合わないと感じたら、遠慮なく断ってください。\n\nアローラ地方にある海の民の村の港で、バブルティーを飲みながらくつろいでいるアシレーヌをお願いできますか？\nシーフォーク村がどのようなところか、例を挙げてみますと、https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14lkUC0j4jSJX1w7k2_W361TQlANwt0Mx?usp=share_link。\nアシレーヌの参考文献 : https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XiyopOEU6l44m_StMluPGS74escOM1Wp/view?usp=share_link\n\nこのリクエストは、あなたの好きなように描いてください。もし、やりすぎだと感じたり、納得のいくものでなければ、お断りください。\nこの依頼があなたに合うことを祈っています。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@o_ko_ge__/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7513b4ea/uploads/origins/3bb34f47-76c6-46c8-a84b-4b8bbf39400d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3f95c8fbc2b5db2cc193279d6c9cec81", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7513b4ea/uploads/origins/3bb34f47-76c6-46c8-a84b-4b8bbf39400d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3f95c8fbc2b5db2cc193279d6c9cec81, https://si.imgix.net/7513b4ea/uploads/origins/3bb34f47-76c6-46c8-a84b-4b8bbf39400d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e822919b01d7a28f54d6e1b65b57eccc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7513b4ea/uploads/origins/3bb34f47-76c6-46c8-a84b-4b8bbf39400d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b11045ba9b1865d592590b093dbb1711 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@o_ko_ge__/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d271d298/uploads/origins/4d7a5d45-46ed-4949-98e2-6e3d3533aa5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2473083ea4e3ae4b2b4c7a9e227a4f6d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d271d298/uploads/origins/4d7a5d45-46ed-4949-98e2-6e3d3533aa5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2473083ea4e3ae4b2b4c7a9e227a4f6d, https://si.imgix.net/d271d298/uploads/origins/4d7a5d45-46ed-4949-98e2-6e3d3533aa5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03839cf270e3a6760de8ea68806f5de1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d271d298/uploads/origins/4d7a5d45-46ed-4949-98e2-6e3d3533aa5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f771b42d65760321c15621f4607b5005 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again Okoge-sensei! Thank you so much for working with me before. Am I able to request another skeb from you?\nCould I please request the two same characters Tash and her Zangoose?\n\nThis time I would really love a christmas theme artwork, where Tash and Zangoose are decorating a christmas tree together! I will leave the details up to you. \n\nThank you for your time, and I hope you have a nice christmas holiday too!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/13148889.natasha-blauvos/gallery", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@o_ko_ge__/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b1216f5/uploads/origins/53282e66-2c6d-4f14-9352-8fbcdad47b9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80885e3255202930c23781d5adfe891f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b1216f5/uploads/origins/53282e66-2c6d-4f14-9352-8fbcdad47b9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80885e3255202930c23781d5adfe891f, https://si.imgix.net/2b1216f5/uploads/origins/53282e66-2c6d-4f14-9352-8fbcdad47b9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=274af904ed7c3cd993d06d8c2cfa42a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b1216f5/uploads/origins/53282e66-2c6d-4f14-9352-8fbcdad47b9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=662078524d35c2dd9d58802ef03f1988 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, nice to met you! I really love your pokemon artwork! I hope it is not too much trouble, but could I request my pokemon trainer and her partner zangoose? \n\nTash: https://toyhou.se/13148889.natasha-blauvos/gallery she is a very cute and energetic trainer. She loves her zangoose a lot. I would love to see Tash in this outfit: https://toyhou.se/13148889.natasha-blauvos/gallery#56269796\nzangoose: very grumpy, but would do anything to protect Tash. Please note he is fluffy and has purple claws!\n\nconcept: I would love a peaceful artwork of zangoose curled up asleep, while Tash is petting his fur. Maybe they are under the shade of a tree in a beautiful field of flowers?\n\nI hope this is not too much trouble, but I understand if you have to decline. Thank you for your time!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@o_ko_ge__/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/462394cf/uploads/origins/b93475a4-f7a0-4cf2-a261-fd684df943c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78312f3b3ecf1c8321d794cc54a9dfc7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/462394cf/uploads/origins/b93475a4-f7a0-4cf2-a261-fd684df943c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78312f3b3ecf1c8321d794cc54a9dfc7, https://si.imgix.net/462394cf/uploads/origins/b93475a4-f7a0-4cf2-a261-fd684df943c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43144507e008940d731aaea7031e687b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/462394cf/uploads/origins/b93475a4-f7a0-4cf2-a261-fd684df943c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=483049c6a4d4f19bf61e2ed5312f9117 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、Okogeです。私はあなたの絵が本当に大好きです、あなたに依頼したいです。\n\nケリーは砂漠の真ん中にある大きなオアシスの水の近くを飛んでいて、景色と飛行を楽しんでいます。ルークも近くの木のそばを飛んでいて、小さな枝を持ち、オランベリーを口にしています。ケリーが飛んでいる水辺の近くの茂みに、もう一つベリーがあるのを彼は見ています。\n\nケリー・レフスは服を必要としている それはレフスの中にある https://imgur.com/a/Fq4DB9t\nluke reffs https://imgur.com/a/ji7l3r1\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Fq4DB9t", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}